00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.790
So as APIs are
powering innovation

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:13.710
across these segments, what does
this mean for operations teams?

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:16.920
As you continue to follow your
business critical applications

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:20.460
and services with APIs, there
is an increasing pressure

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:23.650
on operations teams to
stay on top of that,

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:26.350
