security perspective.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:29.100
So some of the challenges
that they face today

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:33.090
are to gain complete visibility
into the security attributes

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:37.290
of the APIs, to ensure
that whatever developers

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:41.280
are building are compliant with
the industry and organization's

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.840
compliance requirements.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:47.550
They also want to make sure that
whenever there is an incident,

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:49.530
they want to know
about this incident,

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:52.110
even if it impacts
their business.

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:55.890
And if at all there is an
incident and that is impacting,

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:59.370
they want to be able to very
quickly diagnose and identify

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:02.400
the root cause of the
issue so that they

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:05.580
can take the most
appropriate remedial actions

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:09.430
and resolve the issues
faster and fast as possible.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.940
On the other hand,
what is also happening

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:15.900
